                    132.0,
                    488.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For the work performed on Saturday or Sunday, the eight (8) hour pay periods will be applied on the basis of two (2) pay periods of time and one-half and one (1) period at no pay.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                502,
