            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. Notwithstanding the provisions of paragraph seven (7) above, in the event a delay or layover occurs and an employee is relieved from duty he shall be on his own time without pay. However, the employees shall be guaranteed a minimum amount of pay equivalent to eight (8) hours' pay at straight time their base rate during each workday (the successive twenty-four (24) hour periods commencing with reporting time on a run) while away from the Plant on a run.",
